# Test dictionary with noun case annotations
# Format: word/~annotations # comment

Baum/~NML # Baum - nominative masculine
Baum/~NMM # Baum - accusative masculine
Baum/~NMD # Baum - dative masculine
Baum/~NMG # Baum - genitive masculine

Haus/~NML # Haus - nominative neuter
Haus/~NMM # Haus - accusative neuter
Haus/~NMD # Haus - dative neuter
Haus/~NMG # Haus - genitive neuter

Frau/~NFL # Frau - nominative feminine
Frau/~NFM # Frau - accusative feminine
Frau/~NFD # Frau - dative feminine
Frau/~NFG # Frau - genitive feminine

Männer/~NMP # Männer - nominative plural masculine
Häuser/~NNP # Häuser - nominative plural neuter
Frauen/~NFP # Frauen - nominative plural feminine